Subject: Cantor Provider-Free Self-Work Composition P0 Input Audit

@ [audit_uuid] a353241f-abd3-466f-ab09-8e7d4b6b73bb
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] 9c4c374d-db80-4a0b-b186-cff44e2916af
@ [predecessor_commit] be06cdd41d28df47a730bcf616396d60a38c5252

& [ReusableInterfaces]
  + SOP boot proposal is transitively embedded and validated by the objective work-plan proposal
  + work-plan proposal is transitively embedded and validated by the lifecycle request
  + lifecycle checkpoints replay every transition from the deterministic initial checkpoint
  + SWA-04A handoff validates one exact ready attempt supplied workspace admission and bounded proposed changes without physical contact
  + SWA-06A validates one exact ready propose_succeeding_sop attempt complete direct dependencies causal evidence raw source attribution and a self-contained machine receipt

& [ExactJoin]
  + both downstream requests must contain byte-equal lifecycle requests
  + the handoff checkpoint transitions must equal an exact prefix of the succeeding checkpoint transitions and the corresponding checkpoint state must equal replay of that prefix
  + the handoff plan step must be class propose_update and ready at the prefix checkpoint
  + the same selected attempt must be complete at the later checkpoint
  + one bridge evidence identity must occur in handoff evidence and a later transition for that exact update attempt
  + the succeeding plan step must remain class propose_succeeding_sop ready at the later checkpoint and SWA-06A revalidation remains unmodified

& [AuthorityAudit]
  + all embedded admission capability review and lifecycle receipts are supplied forms and no physical freshness authenticity or work truth is inferred
  + wrapper compilation may recompile and compare pure outputs only
  + wrapper verification authority is supplied_data_correspondence_only and physical_contact false

& [DependencyDecision]
  + implement inside cantor_ecosystem because that crate already joins cantor_core lifecycle/SWA-06A forms with the SWA-04A workspace-admission handoff
  + add no dependency feature lockfile provider or platform delta

& [Residuals]
  + actual update verification acceptance rollback cleanup publication semantic review signature activation and live provider remain outside
